{"vid":"kLPBmwGryOI","source":"kLPBmwGryOI.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0.7,"txt":"Sir, I'm so sorry. No matter what I do,"},{"t":2.7,"txt":"I cannot figure out how to get this"},{"t":4.5,"txt":"motor to start. Oh, did you check the"},{"t":7,"txt":"coil on the PLC? Is that working? Uh,"},{"t":11.7,"txt":"okay. Um,"},{"t":13.9,"txt":"Oh, how about the relay coil? Is the"},{"t":15.8,"txt":"relay coil on? Uh,"},{"t":19.7,"txt":"ah, I know. Is the coil on the contactor"},{"t":22.3,"txt":"getting sucked in?"},{"t":23.9,"txt":"Uh,"},{"t":26.2,"txt":"sometimes those motor coils go bad. Did"},{"t":28.6,"txt":"you ring out the coils on the motor?"},{"t":31.2,"txt":"Uh,"},{"t":33.4,"txt":"I quit."},{"t":34.7,"txt":"All right, today we're going to talk"},{"t":35.7,"txt":"about some of the lingo as it pertains"},{"t":37.5,"txt":"to motor controls, industrial"},{"t":39.1,"txt":"automation, stuff like that. And we'll"},{"t":41.2,"txt":"start with what we talked about in the"},{"t":42.6,"txt":"intro, the word coil. Skill tradesmen"},{"t":46,"txt":"love to overuse the word coil. You just"},{"t":48,"txt":"need to know coil really refers to two"},{"t":50.2,"txt":"things. It's either referring to an"},{"t":51.7,"txt":"output or it's referring it to an"},{"t":54.4,"txt":"electromagnet. PLC output, that's a"},{"t":56.9,"txt":"coil. That output energizes the relay"},{"t":60,"txt":"magnet. So, the electromagnet in a"},{"t":62.3,"txt":"relay, we call that the coil. The"},{"t":64.4,"txt":"electromagnet inside of a motor"},{"t":66.2,"txt":"contactor, that's also the coil. Hell,"},{"t":69.2,"txt":"the electromagnets inside of a motor,"},{"t":72,"txt":"those are the coils."},{"t":74.4,"txt":"Now, those are not the only things that"},{"t":76.2,"txt":"are going to trip you up when we get out"},{"t":78,"txt":"in the field. Just realize that, you"},{"t":80.8,"txt":"know, we don't always use the technical"},{"t":82.5,"txt":"words to describe things. Like, if you"},{"t":84.6,"txt":"look at this contactor, you see the"},{"t":87.6,"txt":"contacts, right?"},{"t":90,"txt":"The motor power goes through the"},{"t":93,"txt":"contacts uh, inside of this contactor."},{"t":96.3,"txt":"Those contacts, if they're all gross and"},{"t":98.7,"txt":"messed up and burnt, we call that pitted"},{"t":101.3,"txt":"contacts. But, we also got other"},{"t":104.3,"txt":"contacts on this contactor. If you look"},{"t":106.2,"txt":"on the side, we got some auxiliary"},{"t":107.8,"txt":"contacts. People often call those auxes,"},{"t":111.5,"txt":"you know, check the aux. Aux- auxiliary"},{"t":114.4,"txt":"contact, those are the things on the"},{"t":116.2,"txt":"contactor that are telling you if it's"},{"t":118,"txt":"on. There's auxiliary contacts on the"},{"t":120.4,"txt":"overload and while we're talk while"},{"t":123,"txt":"we're talking about the overload unit"},{"t":125.7,"txt":"on this motor starter, you run the power"},{"t":127.8,"txt":"through the contacts on the motor"},{"t":128.9,"txt":"starter and then at the bottom here,"},{"t":130.5,"txt":"it's running through the overload unit."},{"t":132.7,"txt":"There's different types of overload"},{"t":134.1,"txt":"units. You got your electronic overload"},{"t":136.4,"txt":"units or you got your thermal overload"},{"t":138.9,"txt":"units. Runs through these little"},{"t":140.2,"txt":"doohickeys and if it heats up to a"},{"t":142.4,"txt":"certain extent, the thing actually moves"},{"t":145.7,"txt":"and a little spring-loaded trigger will"},{"t":147.8,"txt":"pop out and it will open up your"},{"t":150.5,"txt":"normally closed auxiliary contact on the"},{"t":153.1,"txt":"side and you need to know that people"},{"t":155.9,"txt":"will call these heated heaters. People"},{"t":158.7,"txt":"will call these heaters. It's a heating"},{"t":160.6,"txt":"element. A thermal overload is also"},{"t":163.5,"txt":"known as a heater. Guess what? If you're"},{"t":165.9,"txt":"using an electronic overload, people"},{"t":168.1,"txt":"will also call that a heater. So, when"},{"t":171.5,"txt":"they tell you to check the heaters,"},{"t":173.2,"txt":"you're checking the overload. You're"},{"t":175,"txt":"resetting the heaters, you're resetting"},{"t":177,"txt":"the overload unit."},{"t":178.8,"txt":"Now, there is a reason we're really just"},{"t":180.3,"txt":"covering motor control stuff in this"},{"t":182,"txt":"video and that's because motor controls"},{"t":184.1,"txt":"are fundamental to everything we do. If"},{"t":186.7,"txt":"you understand motor controls and you"},{"t":188.2,"txt":"understand it like the back of your"},{"t":189.3,"txt":"hand, you're really going to have a"},{"t":190.5,"txt":"solid foundation in your career in"},{"t":192.3,"txt":"automation. So, we might as well start"},{"t":194.5,"txt":"there. Let's go over a couple more terms"},{"t":196.4,"txt":"that have to do with motor controls and"},{"t":198.5,"txt":"some of the auxiliary devices that we'll"},{"t":200.4,"txt":"find contributing to our motor control"},{"t":203.1,"txt":"system."},{"t":205.4,"txt":"When we're troubleshooting a bad motor,"},{"t":207.5,"txt":"there's two things that we really need"},{"t":208.8,"txt":"to watch out for. One of them is single"},{"t":211.2,"txt":"phasing. What single phasing is"},{"t":213.4,"txt":"basically when we lose one of our"},{"t":215.3,"txt":"phases. So, we're getting two of the"},{"t":217.6,"txt":"three phases going into our three phase"},{"t":219.5,"txt":"motor, whether it's through a blown"},{"t":221.4,"txt":"fuse, pitted contacts in your contactor"},{"t":225,"txt":"or even possibly just a loose wire"},{"t":227.2,"txt":"somewhere. Single phasing. Now, if"},{"t":229.8,"txt":"you're troubleshooting your motor, you"},{"t":231,"txt":"troubleshoot your contactor and"},{"t":232.6,"txt":"everything appears to be working in your"},{"t":235.3,"txt":"control circuit, but the motor will not"},{"t":238.4,"txt":"turn. A lot of times, your boss will"},{"t":240.4,"txt":"tell you to go meg the motor. Hey Greg,"},{"t":243.4,"txt":"go meg the motor. Sweet. What does that"},{"t":246.1,"txt":"mean? Meg stands for megger."},{"t":250.3,"txt":"Megger stands for megaohm meter. We are"},{"t":255.6,"txt":"We use a megaohm meter to shoot voltage"},{"t":259,"txt":"down one of the coils into our motor,"},{"t":261.8,"txt":"and then we put our other lead to"},{"t":263.3,"txt":"ground, and we're actually measuring the"},{"t":265.3,"txt":"insulation around the coils inside of"},{"t":268.3,"txt":"our motor, and that goes with what we"},{"t":270.6,"txt":"talked about earlier, ringing out the"},{"t":273.2,"txt":"coils. You're measuring the resistance"},{"t":275.3,"txt":"on the coil."},{"t":276.9,"txt":"Ringing out always means checking"},{"t":279.7,"txt":"resistance. For megging a motor, you"},{"t":282,"txt":"want to do it inside of the pecker head."},{"t":283.9,"txt":"There's another word for you. The pecker"},{"t":285.9,"txt":"head is just the little junction box"},{"t":287.8,"txt":"that's attached to the motor. It's that"},{"t":289.8,"txt":"little box on the side of the motor"},{"t":291.4,"txt":"where all the wires go in. No, we don't"},{"t":293.7,"txt":"call it a junction box, pecker head."},{"t":297.2,"txt":"So, I think that just about covers motor"},{"t":298.6,"txt":"controls. I know this is a really quick"},{"t":300.5,"txt":"video, guys, and I appreciate you"},{"t":302,"txt":"sticking around for it. Hopefully, some"},{"t":304.5,"txt":"of these terms will help you guys. If I"},{"t":306.4,"txt":"forgot some stuff, feel free to comment,"},{"t":308.6,"txt":"and um I'm working on some more"},{"t":310.1,"txt":"technical videos, some demonstrations,"},{"t":312.7,"txt":"and uh I really appreciate you guys."},{"t":314.3,"txt":"Thanks for checking out the channel, and"},{"t":315.6,"txt":"I will catch you next time."}],"words":[{"t":0.72,"w":"Sir,"},{"t":1,"w":"I'm"},{"t":1.16,"w":"so"},{"t":1.4,"w":"sorry."},{"t":1.76,"w":"No"},{"t":1.88,"w":"matter"},{"t":2.12,"w":"what"},{"t":2.32,"w":"I"},{"t":2.